Package: PhenoMapR
Type: Package
Title: Mapping Phenotypic Signal From Bulk Expression Across Single Cell and Spatial Transcriptomics Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Brooks", "Benard", email = "bbenard@stanford.edu", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Calculate prognostic scores for bulk, single-cell, and spatial 
    transcriptomics data using weighted sum of gene expression and prognostic 
    z-scores from PRECOG, TCGA, and ICI datasets.
